        <figure xml:id="fig-kenya-graticule">
            <caption>Nine towns of Kenya and its neighbours on a grid of latitude and longitude.</caption>
            <image width="70%">
                <shortdescription>A latitude-longitude grid from 32 degrees E to 43 degrees E and 7 degrees S to 5 degrees N, with the equator drawn thick and nine towns plotted.</shortdescription>
                <description><p>Positions plotted: Nairobi 1°17'S, 36°49'E; Mombasa 4°03'S, 39°40'E; Kisumu 0°06'S, 34°45'E; Lodwar 3°07'N, 35°36'E; Kampala 0°19'N, 32°35'E; Dar es Salaam 6°48'S, 39°17'E; Garissa 0°27'S, 39°39'E; Lamu 2°16'S, 40°54'E; Mandera 3°56'N, 41°52'E.</p></description>
                <latex-image>
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.9cm, y=0.9cm]
